  "description": "PureSharpCompress is a compression library for NET Standard 2.0/NET 4.8/NET 4.8.1/NET 6.0/NET 8.0 that can unrar, decompress 7zip, decompress xz, zip/unzip, tar/untar lzip/unlzip, bzip2/unbzip2 and gzip/ungzip with forward-only reading and file random access APIs. Write support for zip/tar/bzip2/gzip is implemented.",
